{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder, multiprofile, avgpool aggregation, and no fusion, removing the weighted fusion from config_037. Validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275 are lower than config_037's 0.7062, suggesting fusion may contribute to performance. However, the RNA encoder's role and interactions with aggregation remain uncertain without direct comparison to other unimodal baselines."
}

